It sounds like there was some issues with the network connection so that the original installation couldn't be completed.

When you tried to re-install MSstats via Skyline, did you 1) uninstall all versions of R on your computer, and 2) delete the R folders from program file & documents? This is important as some conflicting issues may occur due to different versions of R and related files. It would be even better to delete all the R-related entries from regedit. See, for example
http://www.wikihow.com/Clean-the-Windows-Registry-by-Hand

It should resolve the issue to re-install MSstats after all these cleaning steps.

HTH
Tsung-Heng

